What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
int n = 6;
int steps = 0;
while (n > 1) {
    if (n % 2 == 0)
        n /= 2;
    else
        n = 3 * n + 1;
    steps++;
}
System.out.println(steps + " " + n);
```

