for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
    if (s.charAt(i) == ' ')
        spaces++;
    if (s.charAt(i) != ' ' && (i == 0 || s.charAt(i - 1) == ' '))
        words++;
}
System.out.println(words + " " + (spaces + 1));
```

What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
